# Keep the lambda small, and keep destructive tooling out of a deployed bundle.
#
# `scripts/` holds seeders and migrations that write to (and in places delete
# from) Firestore. They are guarded by scripts/lib/prodGuard.js, but the safest
# guard is not shipping them next to production credentials at all.
scripts/
tests/
preview/
prisma/

# Local-only artifacts
db.json
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
serviceAccountKey.json

# Docs
*.md
